<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.member.reads ~ the public record of admits, granting nothing

`lares nexus members list=true [nexus=<aid>]` folds one Nexus's members board, the public record of the admits its kahu signed, as this replica last synced it. It grants nothing.

<<~/ahu>>

